Why Is Demand Increasing
Health-Focused Beverage Demand: Younger consumers are increasingly seeking lower-sugar, natural, and functional beverages, encouraging brands to introduce herbal ingredients, plant-based milk, and natural sweeteners.
Cultural Premiumization: New-style tea combines traditional tea foundations with contemporary flavors, premium ingredients, distinctive presentation, and experiential retail concepts.
International Expansion: Leading Chinese tea chains are extending into Southeast Asia, North America, Europe, and other markets through franchising, digital ordering, and localized menus.

